        },
        {
          "url": "https://www.t-mobile.com/news/network/t-mobile-activates-t-satellite-and-mobilizes-network-teams-tropical-storm-lala-hawaii",
          "name": "T-Mobile — T-Satellite activated ahead of Lala",
